OL,3,APortsmouth small boats protest 'a
OL,4,Awake-up call for government', local
OL,5,Apolice commissioner says
OL,6,
OL,7,FOne protester in Portsmouth tells the
OL,8,FBBC people are "absolutely fed up" with
OL,9,Fsmall boat arrivals - another resident
OL,10,Fcalls the scenes a "shock"
OL,12,FIt's thought more than 500 migrants
OL,13,Fcrossed the Channel in small boats
OL,14,Fyesterday - although overall, figures
OL,15,Fare down in 2026
